{"sha": "57ec3d762b5f52faf4d5407061e101a2357f81ff89d0e938f217b7ad43374008", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\tdplotsetmaincoords{60}{100}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[tdplot_main_coords, font=\\small]", "  \\pic {omcubeo={3}};", "  \\node[cellA=3.6mm] at (0,0,0) {};", "  \\node[cellsite=4mm, draw=omThm, fill=omThm!30] at (0,1.5,0) {};", "  \\node[cellA=3.6mm] at (0,3,0) {};", "  \\node[cellsite=4mm, draw=omThm, fill=omThm!30] at (0,0,1.5) {};", "  \\node[cellA=3.6mm] at (0,1.5,1.5) {};", "  \\node[cellsite=4mm, draw=omThm, fill=omThm!30] at (0,3,1.5) {};", "  \\node[cellsite=4mm, draw=omThm, fill=omThm!30] at (1.5,0,0) {};", "  \\node[cellA=3.6mm] at (0,0,3) {};", "  \\node[cellA=3.6mm] at (1.5,1.5,0) {};", "  \\node[cellsite=4mm, draw=omThm, fill=omThm!30] at (0,1.5,3) {};", "  \\node[cellsite=4mm, draw=omThm, fill=omThm!30] at (1.5,3,0) {};", "  \\node[cellA=3.6mm] at (0,3,3) {};", "  \\node[cellA=3.6mm] at (1.5,0,1.5) {};", "  \\node[cellsite=5mm, draw=omThm, fill=omThm!30] at (1.5,1.5,1.5) {};", "  \\node[cellA=3.6mm] at (1.5,3,1.5) {};", "  \\node[cellA=3.6mm] at (3,0,0) {};", "  \\node[cellsite=4mm, draw=omThm, fill=omThm!30] at (1.5,0,3) {};", "  \\node[cellsite=4mm, draw=omThm, fill=omThm!30] at (3,1.5,0) {};", "  \\node[cellA=3.6mm] at (1.5,1.5,3) {};", "  \\node[cellA=3.6mm] at (3,3,0) {};", "  \\node[cellsite=4mm, draw=omThm, fill=omThm!30] at (1.5,3,3) {};", "  \\node[cellsite=4mm, draw=omThm, fill=omThm!30] at (3,0,1.5) {};", "  \\node[cellA=3.6mm] at (3,1.5,1.5) {};", "  \\node[cellsite=4mm, draw=omThm, fill=omThm!30] at (3,3,1.5) {};", "  \\node[cellA=3.6mm] at (3,0,3) {};", "  \\node[cellsite=4mm, draw=omThm, fill=omThm!30] at (3,1.5,3) {};", "  \\node[cellA=3.6mm] at (3,3,3) {};", "  \\node[below] at (1.5,1.5,-1.5) {八面体间隙（红色）};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "\\hspace{1.2cm}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[tdplot_main_coords, font=\\small]", "  \\pic {omcubeo={3}};", "  \\node[cellA=3.6mm] at (0,0,0) {};", "  \\node[cellA=3.6mm] at (0,3,0) {};", "  \\node[cellA=3.6mm] at (0,1.5,1.5) {};", "  \\node[cellsite=4mm, fill=omDef!30] at (0.75,0.75,0.75) {};", "  \\node[cellsite=4mm, fill=omDef!30] at (0.75,2.25,0.75) {};", "  \\node[cellA=3.6mm] at (0,0,3) {};", "  \\node[cellA=3.6mm] at (1.5,1.5,0) {};", "  \\node[cellsite=4mm, fill=omDef!30] at (0.75,0.75,2.25) {};", "  \\node[cellA=3.6mm] at (0,3,3) {};", "  \\node[cellA=3.6mm] at (1.5,0,1.5) {};", "  \\node[cellsite=4mm, fill=omDef!30] at (0.75,2.25,2.25) {};", "  \\node[cellsite=4mm, fill=omDef!30] at (2.25,0.75,0.75) {};", "  \\node[cellA=3.6mm] at (1.5,3,1.5) {};", "  \\node[cellA=3.6mm] at (3,0,0) {};", "  \\node[cellsite=4mm, fill=omDef!30] at (2.25,2.25,0.75) {};", "  \\node[cellA=3.6mm] at (1.5,1.5,3) {};", "  \\node[cellA=3.6mm] at (3,3,0) {};", "  \\node[cellsite=4mm, fill=omDef!30] at (2.25,0.75,2.25) {};", "  \\node[cellsite=4mm, fill=omDef!30] at (2.25,2.25,2.25) {};", "  \\node[cellA=3.6mm] at (3,1.5,1.5) {};", "  \\node[cellA=3.6mm] at (3,0,3) {};", "  \\node[cellA=3.6mm] at (3,3,3) {};", "  \\draw[omDef!70!black, thin] (0,0,0) -- (0.75,0.75,0.75) -- (1.5,1.5,0)", "    (0.75,0.75,0.75) -- (1.5,0,1.5) (0.75,0.75,0.75) -- (0,1.5,1.5);", "  \\node[below] at (1.5,1.5,-1.5) {四面体间隙（蓝色）};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small FCC 晶胞的间隙位置。左：位于", "中心的八面体间隙，以及位于棱中点的八面体间隙（每个由四个晶胞共享）。右：", "八个四面体间隙位于八个小立方体的中心，", "图中画出其中一个并与其四个原子相连。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{金属键与合金}", "", "\\begin{definition}[金属键]\\label{def:b1:crystals-metals:metallic-bond}", "在\\emph{金属键}\\index{金属键}中，每个金属原子", "将其价电子交给整个晶体：固体是由阳离子构成的晶格，", "这些阳离子浸没在电子之中，这些电子不专属于任何特定原子，", "并可在晶体中自由运动。该键即阳离子与", "这片共享电子云之间的吸引作用，它没有方向性。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[金属的性质]\\label{prop:b1:crystals-metals:properties}", "金属键可解释金属的性质：可移动的电子", "导电、导热，并反射光（即金属光泽）；由于金属键", "没有方向性，原子层可彼此滑过而", "不破坏晶体（延展性、展性），而密堆积，", "它使近邻数最多，是最常见的结构。", "\\end{proposition}", "\\admitted", "", "\\begin{definition}[合金]\\label{def:b1:crystals-metals:alloy}", "合金是由几种元素组成的金属固体。在", "\\emph{置换型合金}\\index{置换型合金}中，加入元素的原子", "取代晶格上基体的原子，这要求两者", "半径相差在约 15\\,\\% 以内（如铜与镍、铜与", "锌构成黄铜）。在\\emph{间隙型合金}\\index{间隙型合金}中，", "小原子（\\ce{H}、\\ce{C}、\\ce{N}、\\ce{B}）占据基体的", "间隙位置（如钢中的碳）。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{definition}[同素异形体]\\label{def:b1:crystals-metals:allotropy}", "同一元素的不同晶体结构称为其", "\\emph{同素异形体}\\index{同素异形体}。铁在", "室温下为体心立方（$\\alpha$-铁）；实测其在 \\qty{1189}{K} 至", "\\qty{1661}{K} 之间为面心立方（$\\gamma$-铁），而在 \\qty{1662}{K} 时又为体心立方（$\\delta$-铁），", "直到熔点。碳以金刚石与石墨两种形式存在", "（见\\cref{ch:b1:crystals-ionic-covalent}）。", "% ledger: lat:Fe-alpha, lat:Fe-gamma-1189, lat:Fe-gamma-1661,", "% lat:Fe-delta-1662", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{example}[钢]\\label{ex:b1:crystals-metals:steel}", "碳的共价半径为 \\qty{77}{pm}（即金刚石中 \\ce{C-C}", "键长的一半），若不发生畸变，它对铁的间隙位置而言过大，但", "在 $\\gamma$-铁中则小得多，其八面体间隙最大。钢", "是通过在高温 $\\gamma$-铁中溶解碳制得的；淬火时，碳", "随铁转变回体心结构而被截留，此结构会使", "晶体发生畸变，畸变后的晶体很硬。", "% ledger: lat:C-diamond (r = a sqrt3 / 8 = 77.2 pm)", "\\end{example}", ""]}